2	//!
3	//! Two sources feed a snapshot: the sidecar tip metadata (`storage::metadata_dir`)
4	//! and the capture-session working tree (`config_host_dir` after `branch edit`, or
5	//! the inline residual/ dir). Working records win on id collision so an operator
6	//! sees uncommitted capture-session work in the landscape.
